  "top10": {
    "introHtml": "<p>Top 10 picks for a cheap fun 4-seat convertible near Media, PA \u2014 ranked by condition over miles. This refresh found <strong>26 Cars.com</strong>, <strong>80 CarGurus</strong>, and <strong>59 AutoTrader</strong> convertibles in budget before filtering. After excluding 2-seaters and personal excludes, 37 listings qualified. Images confirmed at 100% coverage for all top10 picks. No manuals confirmed this refresh (see Manual tab). Note: 3VW7A7AT4DM803536 (2013 VW Beetle) appears on both Cars.com and CarGurus \u2014 listed once per source.</p>",
