        "source": "cars.com",
        "whyGood": "Only 39,772 miles on a 2012 BMW 128i convertible is the lowest-mileage BMW in this search. The E88 128i uses the N52 naturally aspirated inline-6 \u2014 BMW's most reliable modern engine, free of the turbo complications that plague the 135i and 335i. Clean title, no accidents. Selden Motors is a known independent dealer. The 128i is a proper driver's car that doesn't need to be babied.",
