        "whyGood": "48,371 miles on a twin-turbo BMW 135i convertible is genuinely low for an N54 engine car. The N54 makes 300hp stock and is the base platform for legendary tuned builds. The E88 135i is a compact RWD sports convertible with 4 real seats. At $11,995 this is near the top of the budget but the mileage justifies it. The 135i was available with a 6-speed manual \u2014 worth confirming.",
