        "whyGood": "A 2016 Audi A3 Cabriolet at 4 miles away from Media, PA is the closest car in the search. Private seller listing through a marketplace, no accidents, 84K miles on the 2.0T is still mid-life territory. The 8V A3 Cabriolet is a refined, modern 4-seater with Audi quality interiors, MMI infotainment, and AWD available (check if Quattro). The 2.0T TFSI is known for reliability when oil changes are kept current.",
        "whatToVerify": "Soft-top operation (Audi A3 cabriolet tops are generally reliable). Check for any DSG transmission jerks/hesitation at low speed (DSG service at 40K intervals). Inspect underside for oil leaks from the 2.0T \u2014 cam follower wear is a known issue. Pull CarFax or AutoCheck to verify the no-accidents claim. Check for carbon buildup on intake valves (direct injection). Ask for all service records.",
